<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Clarim diario</title>
</head>

<style>
    .container{
        display: flex;
    }
    .leftColumn{
        
        position: relative;
        
    }
    #spider-man{
        width: 1100px;
        height: 700px;
        margin: 0px;
    }
    .rightColumn{
        margin-left: 20px;
        flex: 1;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;    
    }
    hr{
        border: none;
        background-color: black;
        height: 4px;
        margin: 10px 0;
    }
    #main {
    width: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #ff1a1a, #cc0000);
    color: white;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-end; /* joga o texto pra direita */
    align-items: center;
    padding: 15px 40px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    }   

    #main h1{
        margin: 0;
    }

    #main hr{
        display: none;
    }
   
    a{
        text-decoration: none;
        color: black;
    }
    #mainNew{
        margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .news{
        margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .news h2{
        margin-bottom: 25px;
        font-size: 28px;
    }

    body{
        font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;
    }
    
</style>
<body>

    <div id="main">
        <h1>Latest News</h1>
        <hr>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="leftColumn">
            <img id="spider-man" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HDuf0FOXIAAlxpa?format=jpg&name=4096x4096" alt="spider-man Cover">

            <h1 id="mainNew">Boomerang’s Rampage Ends in Midtown Chaos — Spider-Man Intervenes</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="rightColumn">
            <div class="news">
                <h2><a href="">Citizens Speak Out After Scorpion Clash in Queens</a></h2>
                <h2><a href="">Midtown Office Workers Describe Tombstone Showdown</a></h2>
                <h2><a href="">Kingpin Suspected in Coordinated Criminal Activity</a></h2>
                <h2><a href="">Daily Life Disrupted as Fear Spreads Across Neighborhoods</a></h2>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>


</html>
